mad about my multiple affairs."

00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:28.735
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:30.736
You're not gonna get
all the answers

00:04:30.736 --> 00:04:33.105
if you refuse to ask any
of the questions,

00:04:33.105 --> 00:04:35.274
