00:09:51.323 --> 00:09:54.627
mental illness, video games,
and did it flatly.

00:09:54.627 --> 00:09:57.496
-We must reform our
mental health laws

00:09:57.496 --> 00:10:01.266
to better identify
mentally disturbed individuals

00:10:01.266 --> 00:10:04.002
who may commit act of violence

00:10:04.002 --> 00:10:07.939
and make sure those people
not only get treatment,

00:10:07.939 --> 00:10:12.211
but, when necessary,
involuntary confinement.

00:10:12.211 --> 00:10:16.948
Mental illness and hatred
pulls the trigger, not the gun.

00:10:16.948 --> 00:10:18.283
-First of all, he's wrong.

00:10:18.283 --> 00:10:19.918
Second, he sounds
like a fourth grader

00:10:19.918 --> 00:10:22.588
auditioning for the role of the
scarecrow in "Wizard of Oz."

00:10:22.588 --> 00:10:25.658
[ Laughter ]
[as Trump] I would like, uh --

00:10:25.658 --> 00:10:27.526
Line.

00:10:27.526 --> 00:10:28.694
[ Laughter ]

00:10:28.694 --> 00:10:30.028
Brian.

00:10:30.028 --> 00:10:33.231
[ Laughter ]
This was a horrific weekend

00:10:33.231 --> 00:10:34.366
of tragedy and heartbreak

00:10:34.366 --> 00:10:35.868
that no one should ever
have to bear.

00:10:35.868 --> 00:10:37.836
All decent people, everywhere,

00:10:37.836 --> 00:10:39.838
should set themselves
to the task of stopping this

00:10:39.838 --> 00:10:42.474
and expressing solidarity with
and support for

00:10:42.474 --> 00:10:44.743
the oppressed,
marginalized communities

00:10:44.743 --> 00:10:46.144
targeted by this hatred
and violence.

00:10:46.144 --> 00:10:48.114
And, as for our
political leaders,

00:10:48.114 --> 00:10:51.483
the ones who are supposed
to be protecting us,

00:10:51.483 --> 00:10:52.752
all we say is they need to --

00:10:52.752 --> 00:10:54.620
-Get their [bleep] together.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.687
[ Laughter ]
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:55.687 --> 00:10:59.792
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

